# Agents. Shared: CLAUDE.md, the skills in .agents/skills (pinned by
# skills-lock.json) and their .claude/skills links. Personal: the rest of
# .claude (settings.local.json, …) and CLAUDE.local.md. The
# pnpm-drizzle-kit-* skills link into node_modules, so pnpm install brings them.
